What current skill level has the spell that you can enhance? You need more
XP levels to advance from Basic to Skilled than from Unskilled to Basic.
In any case you should see some marker[*] attached to the specific skill,
indicating that you will be able to advance it further if you have enough
XP levels, or that you cannot advance the respective skill further, or you
won't see any indication, meaning that you yet haven't trained the weapon
enough to proceed.

[*] Frankly, I don't know if this marker is suppressed once you're at XL:30.

